    different from it in that respect.

(c) nnedi3 weights:

    RtgmDif/NVEnc/resource/nnedi3_weights.bin

    The neural network weights used by the NNEDI3 deinterlacing filter. They
    come from Tritical's nnedi3, an AviSynth plugin distributed under the GPL -
